{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>The fear of YHWH is for life</b> — because of life, one fears Him." "<b>and satisfied, he lodges, untouched by evil</b> — the one who fears is untouched by evil and does not remember the distress that already befell him, that is, his troubles are not recalled while he is satisfied from the good of El."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:41.655622605Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}